    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I'm not too confident that I did the test right (but it passes for me locally), so let me know if I should change anything. The issue with the code is that I had in the history stuff like `nmap d<Return> <Cmd>wa<Bar>!busted<Return>`, so it would fail when editing. This fixed it. :)",
