        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the PR!\r\n\r\nThe fix in code seems to be okay, but the test was not quite right: a bit too wide effects (adding new command line history entry affects many other test cases) and not enough coverage. And it was into `stable` and not `main` branch.\r\n\r\nSo I pushed a fix myself and it should be part of latest `main`. Hope this is okay.",
